OL,3,AUS House votes on moving forward with
OL,4,AHegseth impeachment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US House of Representatives is
OL,7,Fvoting on whether to proceed a
OL,8,FRepublican congressman's attempt to
OL,9,Fimpeach Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth
OL,11,FLawmakers could advance the measure to
OL,12,Fa full vote or refer to it to the
OL,13,FJudiciary Committee - where it would
OL,14,Flikely die
OL,16,FThe measure accuses Hegseth of waging
OL,17,Fwar on Iran without congressional
OL,18,Fauthorisation - if it passes, a further
OL,19,Fvote in the Senate will still be
OL,20,Frequired to remove him from office
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
